# Stutter: the video address multiplexer UD2's output SA0 (video RAM A0) is stuck at 0. The video draws each even cell twice; the 6502's own screen writes land on even cells too, so every other character is lost.
machine bw2001
title "Stutter"
brief "The BW-2001 starts, but its text stutters: every character appears twice and every other one is missing, so the banner is unreadable."
fault stuck UD2.3Y 0
